Implementation:

```go
// Slug 把一段文本转成小写、以连字符分隔的 slug。
func Slug(s string) string {
	return strings.ToLower(strings.Join(strings.Fields(s), "-"))
}
```

Fields splits around each instance of one or more consecutive white space characters, so "  Hello World  " -> ["Hello","World"] -> "Hello-World" -> lower "hello-world". "a   b" -> "a-b". Good.

